Cursed ones will locate all traps, but display them as if they were
gold.  So you need an uncursed, confused one on fire to tell the portal
apart from all the fire traps, but cursed ones will suffice for earth
and air.  (I can't remember whether all those water squares on the water
plane show up as traps or not.)

